#: src/rs-window.c:490
msgid ""
"No REAC segment is present in the PipeWire graph. reac-pw publishes one node "
"per segment; a segment appears here as soon as it does."
msgstr "No hi ha cap segment REAC al graf de PipeWire. reac-pw publica un node per segment; un segment hi apareixerà tan aviat com ho faci."

#: src/rs-window.c:512
msgid "Preamps"
msgstr "Previs"

#: data/org.freereac.Stageboxes.desktop.in:4
msgid "Set phantom power, pad and sensitivity on every REAC stagebox preamp"
msgstr "Ajusta l'alimentació fantasma, l'atenuador i la sensibilitat de cada previ de caixa d'escenari REAC"

